      "options": {
        "content": "### Generic completion-gap routing\nWhen a PlaybookRun cannot complete, Jason classifies the blocker and routes it to the correct improvement path: Component Engineering, Communication Template Engineering, Capability Backlog, Documentation Assurance, Human Decision, or Bounded Recheck. Unknown blocker classes fail closed. Routing records workflow metadata only and grants no provider/action authority.",
